Parent: #36
Blocked by: #46, #41, #42
Consumes: #38 developmental provenance + #45 complete six-surface quilt field + #46 inherited-corpus recovery/crosswalk + #41 whole-mytheme/deep-seam recovery + #42 primary brief recovery + Phase-3 capstone.

## Why this gate exists

Recovery is only useful if it lets us determine the **right whole**. This gate converts the fully recovered field into the newly minted argument architecture before any canonical node rebuilding.

The inherited argument/concept/etymology files are evidence and provenance. Their counts, boundaries and names have no authority over the new architecture. This ticket decides what distinctions, nodes and relations **ought to exist because of the final argument**, not how to preserve the old inventory.

## Work

First synthesize the genuinely central and useful argument threads from:
- developmental quilt history;
- all six quilt surfaces in their distinct offices;
- Phase-3 capstone developments;
- recovered current/deprecated/orphaned granular material;
- whole-mytheme/deep-source recovery;
- primary venue/Agentworld pressures;
- continuous source-debt support without letting source incompleteness veto thought.

Then derive three co-equal canonical architectures:

### Argument architecture
Determine the actual load-bearing argumentative distinctions, their scopes, dependencies, conjunctions, returns, section consumers and transverse relations. Merge inherited nodes that only separated one operation accidentally; split nodes that currently compress distinct operations; create missing nodes where the new whole requires them; retire or demote nodes whose work belongs elsewhere while preserving provenance.

### Concept architecture
Determine which terms genuinely require instituted definitions, which are aliases or facets, which belong at Symbolon root or another register rather than Concepts, which current nodes are defunct/duplicate/misplaced, and which new concepts are required by the final argument. A concept exists because a stable distinction must be carried and reused, not because a previous agent created a file.

### Etymology architecture
Treat etymologies as a first-class reasoning system. Recover the existing clusters and derive the word-fields the new argument actually needs. Decide where clusters should merge, divide, expand, be retired, or be joined by new histories. Preserve the four evidential registers (philological descent, attested semantic field, operational homology, poetic/phonic re-entry) and route each etymological operation into exact arguments/concepts/sections.

## Required outputs

Create/update:
- `ARGUMENT-CONCEPT-ETYMOLOGY-RECENSUS.md` — inherited-to-ought-be disposition ledger;
- `OUGHT-BE-ARGUMENT-ARCHITECTURE.md`;
- `OUGHT-BE-CONCEPT-ARCHITECTURE.md`;
- `OUGHT-BE-ETYMOLOGY-ARCHITECTURE.md`;
- `LEXICAL-CONSTELLATION-AND-RELATIONAL-OPERATORS.md`;
- `EIGHT-DETERMINATION-TRANSVERSE-MATRIX.md`;
- `CANONICAL-REBUILD-MANIFEST.md` — exact create/update/merge/retire/move operations for the later propagation gate.

## Relational discipline

Carry the eight determinations continuously, with dia-/sym-ballein and Symbolon/Matheme/Mytheme/Episteme offices. Preserve the distinct reasons for arbitration, judgment, measure, valuation, determination, decision, mediation, authority, adjudication, discrimination, selection, orientation, surety, credit, trust, governance, apportionment, reckoning/accounting, recognition and Return rather than collapsing them into one organising noun.

Explicitly integrate power/truth/valuation; mono/poly; identity/non-identity; trust/dependency/deference; nested internality/co-internality; knowledge/power; image/complex/archetype; Śakti and Māyā/Mahāmāyā; Buddhist epistemic dynamics; energetics/plasma; technoscience; oikonomia; whole mythemes; and venue-facing AI/Agentworld pressures where they genuinely change the architecture.

## Acceptance

Done when the new argument can be traversed without reference to inherited node counts, every proposed canonical node has a reason for existing and named relations to its neighbours, every inherited useful operation has a disposition, and the later ratification/propagation gates can rebuild the actual canonical argument/concept/etymology field from this architecture rather than improvising file-by-file.

